WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.614
Email standardization starts with a small set of
explainable transformations Trim

00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:12.372
boundary spaces Convert empty strings to NULL if
blank means missing

00:00:14.107 --> 00:00:19.968
Lowercase the value for a consistent analytical
representation This

00:00:19.981 --> 00:00:25.792
does not validate the email It only standardizes the
representation

00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:26.989
before validation
